@host = http://localhost:5131
@token = paste-access-token-here
@roomId = paste-room-id-here

### Login as seeded admin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@hotel.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Register customer
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test Customer",
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "Customer@123"
}

### Search available rooms
GET {{host}}/api/rooms/search?checkIn=2026-10-10&checkOut=2026-10-13&guests=2&page=1&pageSize=10

### Create booking (customer token)
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "{{roomId}}",
  "checkInDate": "2026-10-10",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-10-13",
  "guests": 2,
  "guestName": "Test Customer",
  "guestEmail": "customer@example.com",
  "guestPhone": "+201000000000",
  "specialRequests": "High floor, please",
  "promoCode": "WELCOME10",
  "paymentMethod": "CashAtHotel"
}

### My bookings
GET {{host}}/api/bookings/mine?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Public hotel information
GET {{host}}/api/hotel

### Amenities
GET {{host}}/api/amenities

### Admin dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Health check
GET {{host}}/api/health
